cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "QuaST: a quadtree spectral-element solver for two-dimensional mantle convection"
abstract: >-
  QuaST solves the incompressible Boussinesq or anelastic Stokes and energy equations
  with Taylor-Hood elements of degree p and p-1 on Gauss-Legendre-Lobatto nodes over a
  quadtree kept 2:1 balanced, with hanging-node continuity enforced exactly and BDF2
  time stepping. The Stokes saddle is solved either by a sparse direct factorisation or
  by matrix-free geometric multigrid, chosen from the problem size and the viscosity
  contrast, and the mesh adapts with a policy that trades error against a fixed leaf
  budget.
authors:
  - family-names: edwardaud
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-13"
